1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,907
Same stock, three completely different charts.

2
00:00:03,276 --> 00:00:03,748
How?

3
00:00:04,850 --> 00:00:09,127
It's the timeframe. Each candle can cover a few seconds, or a whole day.

4
00:00:09,475 --> 00:00:15,151
Group three candles into one, then six, and the noise smooths out. Same market, different zoom.

5
00:00:15,651 --> 00:00:20,947
Many traders use longer candles to see the big trend, and shorter ones to time their entry.

6
00:00:22,151 --> 00:00:26,226
Meme Street's charts go from thirty second candles to one year candles.

7
00:00:26,635 --> 00:00:28,470
Practise at memestreet.net.

